2Ch 32:1 , Sennacherib invading Judah, Hezekiah fortifies himself, and encourages his people;
2Ch 32:9 , Against the blasphemies of Sennacherib, Hezekiah and Isaiah pray;
2Ch 32:21 , An angel destroys the host of the Assyrians;
2Ch 32:24 , Hezekiah praying in his sickness, God gives him a sign of recovery;
2Ch 32:25 , He waxing proud, is humbled by God;
2Ch 32:27 , His wealth and works;
2Ch 32:31 , His error in the ambassage of Babylon;
2Ch 32:32 , He dying, Manasseh succeeds him.
